<title>JAPAN: NTT's foreign procurement up 21 bln yen in 1996/97.</title>
<headline>NTT's foreign procurement up 21 bln yen in 1996/97.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp's procurement of foreign products increased 21 billion yen in the year to March 31, 1997, to 173 billion yen, NTT said on Monday.</p>
<p>Procurement increased in such products as digital switches, optic-fibre cables and transmission equipment, NTT said in a statement.</p>
<p>NTT has not made public the total value of its procurements for the year.</p>
</text>
